rvalo de confianza del 95 % de 7,1 a 17,0. En diciembre se adjudicó el 0 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 0 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 37 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.063,35 euros, se adjudicó en junio de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que se adjudiquen contratos al límite no implica que haya sido un error o que se haya actuado mal. Puede deberse a razones legítimas, como necesidades específicas o precios de mercado.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en años distintos. Analizar si los contratos al límite se distribuyen uniformemente entre los adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 72 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 6.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 10.9, with a 95% confidence interval of 7.1 to 17.0. December accounts for 0% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 0% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 20. Contract [1], for 14,063.35 euros, was awarded in June 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The high ratio suggests a statistical pattern, not misconduct. Prices near the limit may reflect market rates or budget constraints. Legitimate reasons could include fixed budgets or separate needs that don't require exceeding the limit.\nWhat can be checked: Check the awardee A's contracts for repeated purchases of similar services. Review contract [1] to see if the amount aligns with the legal limit and if the service was necessary. Look for patterns in the dates to determine if multiple contracts were awarded for the same need.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["SaXb%2FdacTFrua%2Fi14w%2FPLA%3D%3D","K091vxYeAaPgL1BHd3qjQA%3D%3D","n2xj6pUjpbOIzo3LHNPGcQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}